flowchart LR
  EMAIL[Shared finance mailbox] --> GRAPH[Microsoft Graph adapter]
  UPLOAD[Unified document API] --> DOC[Deterministic document processor tool]
  GRAPH --> DOC
  DOC --> SUP[Qwen 3.5 supervisor agent]
  SUP -->|dispatch AP| ORCH[Parent LangGraph orchestrator]
  SUP -->|dispatch AR| ORCH
  SUP -->|ambiguous / conflict| HUMAN[Unified exception desk]
  ORCH --> AP[AP agent: observe + bounded tools]
  ORCH --> AR[AR agent: observe + bounded tools]
  POLICY[(Policies + pgvector)] --> LLAMA[EmbeddingGemma + LlamaIndex]
  LLAMA --> AP
  LLAMA --> AR
  AP -->|clean| PJ[Payment Journal]
  AR -->|clean| CASH[Cash application]
  AP -->|exception| HUMAN
  AR -->|exception| HUMAN
  HUMAN -->|correct / approved policy path| AP
  HUMAN -->|correct + rematch| AR
  ERPAPI[HTTP Mock ERP API] -->|PO + GR| AP
  ERPAPI -->|open AR items| AR
  PJ --> ERPAPI
  CASH --> ERPAPI
  DOC --> AUDIT[(Hash-chained audit + durable workflow state)]
  ORCH --> AUDIT
  AP --> AUDIT
  AR --> AUDIT
  HUMAN --> AUDIT
  ORCH -. traces .-> PHOENIX[Arize Phoenix]
  AP -. agent + tool spans .-> PHOENIX
  AR -. agent + tool spans .-> PHOENIX
